  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operationalizing the Global Accelerator on Jobs and Social Protection for Just Transitions in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of a Join-Programme on Strengthening social protection and employment systems in response togreen and demographic transitions In Viet Nam, the initiation plan is developed for UNDP&#x2019;s interventions inthis Joint Programme (JP). The JP aims to support the strengthening of the social protection system and accessto productive employment opportunities in response to rapid population aging and green transition for allwomen and men.</narrative>
  </description>
